@startuml
' DRAFT Developer,19.10.2026; no product fact recomputation.
title DRAFT: measured conditional column, local aux and safe revision publish
autonumber
hide footbox
control "ResultController" as Result
participant "Renderer revision" as Wheel
participant "Native measurement surface" as Metrics
participant "Pure layout" as Layout
participant "Private adapter" as DOM
Result -> Result : width/font/selection change; revoke old revision
Result -> Wheel : immutable accepted facts + full-DTO S1 + CSS width
Wheel -> Metrics : glyph/R/angle/conjunction/sign getBBox and font/CTM
Metrics --> Wheel : numeric measured bounds
Wheel -> Layout : ideal references, bounds, immutable source keys
Layout -> Layout : default full conflict graph + foreign true anchors
alt no conflicting point
  Layout -> Layout : no column; keep default point anchors
else point conflict
  Layout -> Layout : reserve measured column/gutter; recompute final C0
  Layout -> Layout : C0 points only, cyclic order, asymmetric row separation
  Layout -> Layout : isotonic row objective; grow height, keep16/12 em
end
Layout -> Layout : freeze nonconflicting labels; local aux bounded candidates
Layout -> Layout : contact compactness; preserve all anchors
Layout -> Layout : route owner paths with ports/detours, no shared segments
alt complete predicates valid
  Layout --> Wheel : measured composition, source identity and coordinates
  Wheel -> Metrics : paint zodiac/cusps/aspects/anchors below labels
  Wheel -> DOM : publish passive own SVG
  DOM -> DOM : guard, validate, clone, recheck, synchronous install
else bounded layout failure
  Layout --> Wheel : concrete counterexample, no glyph hiding/font shrink
  Wheel --> Result : local svg_unavailable
  Result -> DOM : keep current HTML facts; visible local SVG warning
end
note over Wheel, DOM
Exact rational verifier belongs to evidence/tests, not a new runtime dependency.
New column domain is a DRAFT revision; old annular certificates not reused.
29 saved compositions and independent C0/order/row/route audits.
No proof for arbitrary DTO, platform or unlimited conjunction count.
end note
@enduml
